# Signing keys. Never commit these: the app key lets anyone sign an update that
# replaces the one on the projector, and the AVB key signs partition metadata.
*.keystore
*.jks
keys/*.pem
!keys/*.pub.pem

# Working directory: firmware dumps, downloaded APKs, probation logs, device
# pulls. Roughly 1.6 GB of it, none of it ours to publish and much of it a
# record of one particular house's network.
.scratch/

# Build output.
app/out/
keyboard/out/
*.apk
*.idsig
*.dex
*.class

# Partition images and other firmware blobs.
*.img
*.img.gz
*.bin

# Vendor tools fetched rather than written here.
keys/avbtool

# Python's own leavings.
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Editor and OS noise.
.vscode/
.idea/
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Signing keys, including the public halves: you generate your own, and a key
# of mine in your tree can only cause confusion. See docs/EXTERNAL.md.
keys/*
!keys/README.md

# The execution diary and the session handoff. Kept locally: they are the
# author's record of doing this once, not something a reader needs to repeat
# it. The reasoning lives in docs/research/ and docs/decisions/.
RUNBOOK.md
HANDOFF.md

# The probation allow-list entries that belong to one house, not to this project:
# the AirPlay sender, the video sources it is pointed at. Read alongside expected.txt
# by both analyze.py and receiver.py when present.
scripts/probation/expected.txt.local
